# One-off reports and session state. This repository is public, and these files
# carry real paths under ~/.local/share/opencode plus measured data volumes —
# never commit. Root-anchored so a later docs/ tree is not swallowed.
/STATE.md
/PROFILE.md
/AUDIT.md
/PLAN.md
/VERIFY.md
